  "body": "Adds a non-publishing Docker build check workflow for PRs and manual dispatches.\n\n- PR CI now runs a throwaway Docker build with `push: false`\n- Manual dispatch accepts `git_ref` for pre-PR image-packaging feedback\n- The check supplies placeholder build args used by the Dockerfile\n- Agent guidance now points agents at PR CI/manual dispatch instead of local Docker\n\nThis keeps image build verification in GitHub Actions without requiring Docker in session pods.",
